'''Dreaming Baby''' (Korean: '''꿈꾸는 아이''' ''Kkumkkuneun ai'') is the ending theme for the original Korean airing of ''[[M01|Pokémon: The First Movie - Mewtwo Strikes Back]]''. It is performed by Kwon Jinwon.

